            <ArticleTitle>[Use of neruoleptoanalgesia in the postoperative period].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>109-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors recommend a postoperative administration of the mixture consisting of phentanil, droperidol and dimedrol. The mixture would provide anesthesia during 4-10 hours and a peaceful sleep during 2-4 hours. In case of necessity the mixture may be reinjected.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
